positive.prompt:
Open Scope Change Checker's interactive workspace. Then Compare these synthetic new revision requests against the agreed allowance. Treat already-used units separately and combine the two new requests for the same exact scope ID.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "agreedScope": [
    {
      "lineId": "A",
      "label": "Revision allowance",
      "unit": "revision",
      "agreedQuantity": 3,
      "alreadyUsedQuantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "requests": [
    {
      "requestId": "R1",
      "scopeLineId": "A",
      "unit": "revision",
      "requestedQuantity": 2
    },
    {
      "requestId": "R2",
      "scopeLineId": "A",
      "unit": "revision",
      "requestedQuantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

Check these synthetic requests against the scope table. Use exact IDs and identical units; do not match descriptions semantically or convert hours to revisions.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "agreedScope": [
    {
      "lineId": "A",
      "label": "Revision allowance",
      "unit": "revision",
      "agreedQuantity": 3,
      "alreadyUsedQuantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "requests": [
    {
      "requestId": "LOWER",
      "scopeLineId": "a",
      "unit": "revision",
      "requestedQuantity": 99,
      "description": "Revision allowance"
    },
    {
      "requestId": "HOURS",
      "scopeLineId": "A",
      "unit": "hour",
      "requestedQuantity": 99
    }
  ]
}

Compare one new synthetic revision request when the historical work has already exceeded the allowance. Report existing and new overage separately.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "agreedScope": [
    {
      "lineId": "A",
      "label": "Revision allowance",
      "unit": "revision",
      "agreedQuantity": 3,
      "alreadyUsedQuantity": 5
    }
  ],
  "requests": [
    {
      "requestId": "NEW",
      "scopeLineId": "A",
      "unit": "revision",
      "requestedQuantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

Calculate this synthetic change estimate using the supplied rate that I explicitly declare approved. Keep exact USD cents and label the result nonbinding.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "changes": [
    {
      "changeLineId": "C",
      "scopeLineId": "A",
      "unit": "revision",
      "quantity": 3,
      "approvedRateId": "R"
    }
  ],
  "approvedQuotedRates": [
    {
      "rateId": "R",
      "scopeLineId": "A",
      "unit": "revision",
      "rateCents": 12345,
      "currency": "USD",
      "explicitlyApproved": true
    }
  ]
}

Estimate these two synthetic change lines using their exact mapped approved USD rates. Retain the explicitly free asset line and show the total without inventing taxes, fees or discounts.

Use only this synthetic input:
{
  "changes": [
    {
      "changeLineId": "FREE",
      "scopeLineId": "ASSET",
      "unit": "asset",
      "quantity": 3,
      "approvedRateId": "FREE-RATE"
    },
    {
      "changeLineId": "PAID",
      "scopeLineId": "COPY",
      "unit": "page",
      "quantity": 2,
      "approvedRateId": "COPY-RATE"
    }
  ],
  "approvedQuotedRates": [
    {
      "rateId": "FREE-RATE",
      "scopeLineId": "ASSET",
      "unit": "asset",
      "rateCents": 0,
      "currency": "USD",
